# ============================================================================
# Mawzun home/landing frontend — environment template
#
# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and adjust. Vite bakes VITE_* values in at
# BUILD time (`npm run build`), not runtime — rebuild and redeploy to change
# them. There are no runtime secrets: this deployment is a static marketing
# landing and makes no API calls.
# ============================================================================

# Where the app frontend lives. Paths this deployment does not serve
# (/login, /register, /forgot-password, /dashboard…) exit this origin to the
# app deployment (src/lib/navigation.ts).
# Dev default when unset: http://localhost:8081. Production: https://app.mawzun.org
VITE_APP_ORIGIN=https://app.mawzun.org
